    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1429" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾳδμολίη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncertainty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				338
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μωλ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδμωλεί:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρὶς δόλου ἢ δουλείας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδμωλή</span></b> , ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνοια</span>
			, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.324
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδμωλῶ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηδιῶ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδμωλεῖν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνοεῖν ἤ ἀγνωμονεῖν ἢ
			ἀκηδιᾶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				18.33
			</span></i>.</div>
